Rāma beholds crowded city from chariot --- Rāma traverses agaru-fumed merchant highway --- Citizens shower blessings and praise Rāma rule --- Citizens deem Rāma consecration highest joy --- None can withdraw eyes from passing Rāma --- Rāma shows compassion to four varṇas --- Rāma enters shining paternal palace --- Rāma dismisses retinue for inner harem --- Crowd awaits his return like ocean for moon